    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730697830778\" id=\"item-6728553dfc99d0751ae61a8c\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-eb8dcc5ad06a707da459\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us:</strong>  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Property Media Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Four Spacious Bedrooms:</strong> Each bedroom is designed with relaxation in mind, providing ample space, natural light, and quality finishes to create cozy retreats for every family member.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Two Contemporary Bathrooms:</strong> With sleek fixtures and high-end finishes, the bathrooms are crafted to deliver a luxurious experience, offering the ideal space for rejuvenation.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Multiple Living Areas:</strong> The property boasts three distinct living spaces, providing plenty of room for entertaining, relaxing, and family gatherings. These versatile areas are perfect for creating your ideal lifestyle, whether it's a cozy family movie night or hosting guests.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Modern Kitchen:</strong> Equipped with premium appliances, generous storage, and a well-thought-out layout, the kitchen is both functional and stylish. Its open design makes it easy to stay connected with family and friends while preparing meals.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Single-Car Garage:</strong> The secure, attached garage offers both parking and extra storage space, giving you peace of mind and keeping your vehicle protected.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Living Spaces:</strong> Step outside to enjoy landscaped gardens and a private patio area, ideal for alfresco dining, weekend barbecues, or simply unwinding in the fresh air.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Built with quality craftsmanship and designed to suit modern lifestyles, 7 Pennant is more than just a home; it\u2019s a sanctuary. Whether you're a growing family or looking for a serene escape, this property provides a perfect blend of spacious living, contemporary design, and a welcoming environment. Don\u2019t miss the chance to make this beautiful house your new home.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;6728570c33da843e81771fda&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;6728570c33da843e81771fda&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730696809221_17065\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"672857459ebd4e6e30d64d41\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730697035542-LACCCD0COXK7021SORUD/7+Pennant+++Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%282%29.jpg\" alt=\"7 Pennant   Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Property Agent Photographer Videographer (2).jpg\" /></noscript><img class=\"thumb-image\" elementtiming=\"system-gallery-block-stacked\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730697035542-LACCCD0COXK7021SORUD/7+Pennant+++Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%282%29.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730697035542-LACCCD0COXK7021SORUD/7+Pennant+++Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%282%29.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"4000x2670\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"7 Pennant   Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Property Agent Photographer Videographer (2).jpg\" data-load=\"false\" data-image-id=\"672857459ebd4e6e30d64d41\" data-type=\"image\" />\n            \n          </div>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"6728571ffb853d2cb3b0a7b5\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730696998414-KV91X028V6U0OWGUPNLH/7+Pennant+++Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%2811%29.jpg\" alt=\"7 Pennant   Niseko Kut